{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stuck in an endlessly repeating office. Spot and log the anomalies if you ever want to go home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Sprint 0 has no anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Log anomalies inside the elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Failure will return you to Sprint 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. You may go home after completing Sprint 10.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-90 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click - Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift - Run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC - Options/Pause</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993830?t=1757423172","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993830/e186abfeba4686fdae9c8fabe48a82f4b57326e3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757423172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993830/64290ab9d395dd546116c38d4181c1ad61770e11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757423172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993830/64290ab9d395dd546116c38d4181c1ad61770e11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757423172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stuck in an endlessly repeating office. Spot and log the anomalies if you ever want to go home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Sprint 0 has no anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Log anomalies inside the elevator.</p><p clas